  "priorExpiration": "2003-12-29",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 571.09 Utilization Review and Control. The department’s provider program integrity unit shall monitor utilization of items to identify, prevent, and correct potential occurrences of fraud, waste, and abuse, in accordance with 42 CFR 455, 42 CFR 456, and He-W 520.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading He-W 500); ss by #6158, eff 12-29-95, EXPIRED: 12-29-03\n\nNew. #8961, eff 8-20-07; ss by #11046, eff 2-27-16 (from He-W 571.10)",
